              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "le vernissage — \"private view, opening (of an exhibition)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Elle nous a invités au vernissage de son exposition. She invited us to the opening of her exhibition."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "First the last coat of varnish, put on the day before the show."
            }
          ]
        },
