          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "le vernissage is built on vernir \"to varnish\" with -age (EtymDB): painters once varnished their works on the eve of the show. The origin of vernis is usually traced to Medieval Latin veronix."
            }
          ]
